      "Text": "Security update for openssl-1_1",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for openssl-1_1 fixes the following issue\n\n- HollowByte: DoS vector against OpenSSL TLS ClientHello via remote, attacker-controlled memory allocations\n  (bsc#1271712).\n",
